Selection time (UTC): {{ as_of }}

You choose which stocks this strategy should follow from now on: its universe. For every
stock you choose, a later step decides whether to buy, hold or sell it, and independent risk
controls check every trade. Stocks the strategy already holds stay in the universe anyway,
so they can still be sold; you do not need to pick them to keep them.
{%- if watchlist_days %}
Your picks go on the strategy's watchlist and stay followed for {{ watchlist_days }} days after
they were last picked; candidates marked "on the watchlist" are already followed, so pick them
again only if they still clearly fit.
{%- endif %}

Pick AT MOST {{ max_picks }} stocks, only from the candidates below, and only stocks you
would actually want the strategy to consider owning. Picking fewer (or none) is right when
few candidates fit the approach. Every number below was computed by code (prices from
completed daily bars, fundamentals from SEC filings) and is accurate; do not recompute it.
Use only the data shown: if your approach needs information that is missing for a candidate
(e.g. no fundamentals for an ETF), judge it on what is shown or leave it out; never assume
values.

